WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.171 --> 00:00:02.000
SCOTT LANG
I'm an Avenger.

00:00:02.051 --> 00:00:04.007
Everywhere I go people
ask me the same thing.

00:00:04.058 --> 00:00:05.320
MAN
Can you take a picture with my dog?

00:00:08.201 --> 00:00:09.929
SCOTT LANG
I literally saved the world.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.179
HOPE VAN DYNE
How is that for you, Scott?

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:12.406
JANET VAN DYNE
You should write a book about it.

00:00:15.219 --> 00:00:16.351
CASSIE LANG
Where are we?

00:00:16.402 --> 00:00:18.617
SCOTT LANG
It's like we're camping. We love camping.

00:00:18.668 --> 00:00:19.804
CASSIE LANG
We've never been camping.

00:00:21.683 --> 00:00:22.718
SCOTT LANG
We're getting home.

00:00:22.769 --> 00:00:23.453
HOPE VAN DYNE
You ready?

00:00:23.504 --> 00:00:24.664
SCOTT LANG
Kang!

00:00:24.715 --> 00:00:25.515
[Screaming]

